## 2026-08-29 - US-007: Preserve existing AGENTS.md during setup

Completed. Added `writeManagedSection(filePath, content)` helper to
src/setup.ts that wraps nightralph's generated AGENTS.md content in
`<!-- nightralph:start -->` / `<!-- nightralph:end -->` markers.
Three behaviors:

1. No AGENTS.md exists: creates the file with just the managed block.
2. AGENTS.md exists without markers: appends the managed block,
   preserving all existing content above it.
3. AGENTS.md exists with markers: replaces only the content between
   the markers, preserving everything before and after.

Changed the `setup()` function's AGENTS.md writing from a bare
`writeFileSync` to `writeManagedSection`, so existing project-specific
instructions are never silently destroyed.

